-- The METALP portal's own registry, vendored verbatim from
-- `~/projects/RIVER/dumps/metalp_db_prod.sql` (production dump, 2026-03-23).
--
-- The same four pieces as the CNET file beside it: `grab_param_categories` is the category a
-- column belongs to, `parameter_calculations` says which columns are computed and from what,
-- `grab_params_plotting` carries the label and units of the plotted subset, and the `data` DDL
-- says which columns the portal actually stores. `scripts/portal_categories_seed.py` reads both
-- files; `tests/parameters/portal_group_seed.rs` reads them again and checks every row is
-- accounted for. MySQL syntax, never executed against Postgres.

