ected Vaisala handheld average CO2; calculated with temp and BP','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(16,16,'Field data','Vaisala_CO2_max_corr','Corrected Vaisala handheld maximum CO2; calculated with temp and BP','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(17,17,'Field data','Reach_depth_avg_cm','Average reach depth from rep 1-10','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(18,18,'Field data','Reach_depth_sd_cm','St deviation of reach depth from rep 1-10','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(19,19,'Field data','Reach_depth_rep_1','Reach depth rep 1; from field sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(20,20,'Field data','Reach_depth_rep_2','Reach depth rep 2; from field sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(21,21,'Field data','Reach_depth_rep_3','Reach depth rep 3; from field sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(22,22,'Field data','Reach_depth_rep_4','Reach depth rep 4; from field sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(23,23,'Field data','Reach_depth_rep_5','Reach depth rep 5; from field sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(24,24,'Field data','Reach_depth_rep_6','Reach depth rep 6; from field sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(25,25,'Field data','Reach_depth_rep_7','Reach depth rep 7; from field sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(26,26,'Field data','Reach_depth_rep_8','Reach depth rep 8; from field sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(27,27,'Field data','Reach_depth_rep_9','Reach depth rep 9; from field sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(28,28,'Field data','Reach_depth_rep_10','Reach depth rep 10; from field sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(29,29,'Field data','Q_Ls','Discharge from Q excel calculation file','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(30,30,'DOC','DOC_avg_ppb','DOC average from rep 1-3','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(31,31,'DOC','DOC_sd_ppb','DOC st. Deviation from rep 1-3','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(32,32,'DOC','DOC_rep_1','DOC replicate 1; from Sievers output','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(33,33,'DOC','DOC_rep_2','DOC replicate 2; from Sievers output','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(34,34,'DOC','DOC_rep_3','DOC replicate 3; from Sievers output','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(35,35,'DOM','BIX','The biological index (BIX) is an indicator for the presence of autochthonous (microbial-derived) DOM (Huguet et al. 2009) and reflects  the ratio of fresh-like DOM to humic-like DOM.','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(36,36,'DOM','B','Protein-like material (Cobble, 1996)','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(37,37,'DOM','T','Peak T, representing protein-like component.','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(38,38,'DOM','A','Humic-like fluorescence stimulated by UV excitation, indicating the presence of humic substances and recent materials (Cobble, 1996).','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(39,39,'DOM','M','Peak M, indicating marine humic-like component.','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(40,40,'DOM','C','Humic-like fluorescence stimulated by visible excitation and indicating the presence of humic substances (Cobble, 1996).','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(41,41,'DOM','FI','The fluorescence index (FI) distinguishes DOM derived from terrestrial sources (degraded plant and soil organic matter; lower values) vs. microbial sources (extracellular release and leachate from bacteria and algae; higher values) (McKnight et al. 2001; Cory et al. 2007, 2010). FI values in natural waters typically range between 1.2 and 1.8 (e.g., Jaffe et al. 2008; Wilson and Xenopoulos 2009; Cory et al. 2010; Carpenter et al. 2013; Helms et al. 2013; Fleck et al. 2014).','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(42,42,'DOM','HIX','The humification index (HIX) is an indicator of source, diagenesis and sorptive capacity (Zsolnay et al. 1999; Ohno 2002) and informs about the decrease of the ratio of hydrogen to carbon as humification of DOM proceeds, shifting the emission spectra of the fluorescing molecules toward the longer wavelengths with higher values indicating an increasing degree of humification. HIX values commonly range between 0.6 and 0.9 (e.g., Ohno 2002; Chen et al. 2011; Fleck et al. 2014)','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(43,43,'DOM','a254','The a254 indicates humic and aromatic compounds in water (Abbt-Braun et al. 2004)','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(44,44,'DOM','SUVA','The specific ultraviolet absorbance (SUVA) provides a proxy of the hydrophilicity and hydrophobicity of all aromatic dissolved organic carbon (White et al. 1997)','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(45,45,'DOM','a300','The absorption coefficient at 300 nm (a300).','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(46,46,'DOM','E2_E3','Ratio between the absorption coefficient at 250 nm (a250) and the absorption coefficient at 365 nm (a365). Estimates the relative composition of autochthonous vs. terrestrial DOM.','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(47,47,'DOM','E4_E6','Fulvic to humic ratio (E4/E6), calculated between the absorption coefficient at 250 nm (a250) and the absorption coefficient at 365 nm (a365).','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(48,48,'DOM','S275_295','Spectral slope S275-295','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(49,49,'DOM','S350_400','Spectral slope S350-400','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(50,50,'DOM','S300_700','Spectral slope S300-700','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(51,51,'DOM','SR','The slope ratio SR (S275–295/S350–400) has been linked to shifts in DOM molecular weight and photobleaching (Helms et al. 2008), with steeper slope ratios reflective of greater amounts of low molecular weight compounds.','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(52,52,'DOM','A_T','An indication of the amount of humic-like (recalcitrant) vs. fresh-like (labile) fluorescence in a sample [ratio of Peak A (ex260/em450) to Peak T (ex275/em304) intensity].','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(53,53,'DOM','C_A','An indication of the amount of humic-like vs. Fulvic-like fluorescence in a sample [ratio of Peak C (ex340/em440) to Peak A (ex260/em450) intensity].','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(54,54,'DOM','C_M','An indication of the amount of diagenetically altered (blue-shifted) fluorescence in a sample [ratio of Peak C (ex340/em440) to Peak M (ex300/em390) intensity].','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(55,55,'DOM','C_T','An indication of the amount of humic-like (recalcitrant) vs. fresh-like (labile) fluorescence in a sample [ratio of Peak C (ex340/em440) to Peak T (ex275/em304) intensity].','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(56,56,'Alkalinity','Alk_w_weight_g','Water sample weight (in the becker); from lab sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(57,57,'Alkalinity','Alk_meqL','Alkalinity measured in meqL; from lab sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(58,58,'Alkalinity','Alk_mgL','Alkalinity measured in mgL; from lab sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(59,59,'Alkalinity','Alk_dyn_pH','Alkalinity dynamic pH; from lab sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(60,60,'Alkalinity','Alk_dyn_trit','Alkalinity dynamic tritration; from lab sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(61,61,'Alkalinity','Alk_init_pH','Water initial pH; from lab sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(62,62,'Alkalinity','Alk_temp_degC','Water temperature; from lab sheet','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(63,63,'CO2_air','lab_co2air_ch4','Methane of Air sample; directly from the Picarro output (reported in lab sheet)','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(64,64,'CO2_air','lab_co2air_ich4','Methane isotope of Air sample; directly from the Picarro output (reported in lab sheet)','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(65,65,'CO2_air','lab_co2air_co2ppm','CO2 concentration of Air sample; directly from the Picarro output (reported in lab sheet)','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(66,66,'CO2_air','lab_co2air_co2_dry_ppm','CO2 dry concentration of Air sample; directly from the Picarro output (reported in lab sheet)','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(67,67,'CO2_air','lab_co2air_ico2','CO2 isotope of Air sample; directly from the Picarro output (reported in lab sheet)','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(68,68,'CO2_air','lab_co2air_ch4_dry','Dry methane in air sample; calculated.','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(69,69,'CO2_air','lab_co2air_h2o','H2O content in air sample, from lab sheet','2020-12-21 16:35:10','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(70,70,'pCO2','d13C_CO2_avg','Average of CO2 isotope between lab_co2_ico2_A\" and \"lab_co2_ico2_B\"\"','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(71,71,'pCO2','d13C_CO2_sd','St. Deviation of CO2 isotope between lab_co2_ico2_A\" and \"lab_co2_ico2_B\"\"','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(72,72,'pCO2','CO2_HS_Um_avg','Average of CO2 in water. Calculated from CO2 (ppm) Picarro output as [CO2aq] (uM)','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(73,73,'pCO2','CO2_HS_Um_sd','St. deviation of CO2 in water. Calculated from CO2 (ppm) Picarro output as [CO2aq] (uM)','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(74,74,'pCO2','pCO2_HS_uatm_avg','Average of pCO2 in water. Calculated from CO2 (ppm) Picarro output as pCO2 (uatm)','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(75,75,'pCO2','pCO2_HS_uatm_sd','St. deviation of pCO2 in water. Calculated from CO2 (ppm) Picarro output as pCO2 (uatm)','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(76,76,'pCO2','pCO2_HS_P1_uatm_avg','Average of pCO2 in water. Calculated from CO2 (ppm) Picarro output as pCO2_HS_P1','2012-11-20 21:21:00','2021-01-21 10:20:59'),(77,77,'pCO2','pCO2_HS_P1_uatm_sd','St. deviatio